nejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":1.75,\"opacity\":\"$undefined\"}]]}],\"$L2b\"]}],\"$L2c\",\"$L2d\"]}],\"$L2e\",\"$L2f\",\"$L30\",\"$L31\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"32:T694,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Dataset\",\"name\":\"LLM Stats Leaderboard — AI Models with Live Pricing \u0026 Benchmarks\",\"description\":\"The LLM Leaderboard ranks 300+ AI models by intelligence, output speed, latency and per-token pricing. Independent benchmark scores aggregated into the LLM Stats Score, refreshed continuously from provider APIs and verified evaluations.\",\"url\":\"https://llm-stats.com/\",\"creator\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"LLM Stats\",\"url\":\"https://llm-stats.com\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://llm-stats.com/#organization\"},\"measurementTechnique\":\"Aggregated benchmark scores from public model evaluations and provider-reported results.\",\"spatialCoverage\":\"Worldwide\",\"isAccessibleForFree\":true,\"license\":\"https://llm-stats.com/legal/terms-of-service\",\"citation\":\"LLM Stats (2026). LLM benchmark and pricing dataset. https://llm-stats.com\",\"keywords\":[\"ai leaderboard\",\"ai rankings\",\"ai model comparison\",\"best ai models\",\"top ai models\",\"ai benchmarks\",\"llm rankings\",\"best llm\",\"llm pricing\"],\"variableMeasured\":[\"LLM Stats Score\",\"GPQA Diamond\",\"SWE-Bench Verified\",\"Coding Arena Score\",\"Output throughput (tokens/sec)\",\"Time to first token (s)\",\"Input price (USD per 1M tokens)\",\"Output price (USD per 1M tokens)\",\"Context window (tokens)\",\"License (open weights vs proprietary)\"],\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-13T00:59:45.784Z\",\"distribution\":[{\"@type\":\"DataDownload\",\"name\":\"Models list (JSON)\",\"contentUrl\":\"https://api.zeroeval.com/leaderboard/models/list\",\"encodingFormat\":\"application/json\"},{\"@type\":\"DataDownload\",\"name\":\"Per-model live metrics (JSON)\",\"contentUrl\":\"https://api.zeroeval.com/v1/models/metrics\",\"encodingFormat\":\"application/json\"}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"33:Tf44,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which AI model ranks #1 on the LLM Leaderboard?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"On the LLM Stats Leaderboard, GPT-5.6 Sol currently leads on GPQA Diamond (94.6% gpqa), the most discriminating reasoning benchmark at the frontier. This AI leaderboard ranks models by the LLM Stats Score, which aggregates GPQA, SWE-Bench Verified, coding-arena performance and pricing into one comparable AI ranking. Rankings refresh continuously as new benchmark results land.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the best AI model right now?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"\\\"Best\\\" depends on what you're optimizing for. For frontier reasoning, GPT-5.6 Sol leads on GPQA. For coding agents, Claude Opus 5 is the strongest in head-to-head coding-arena play. For low cost at frontier quality, Grok 4.5 is the cheapest in the top 10 at $2.00 /M tok. The leaders summary above the table names the current winner per axis.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are the best LLMs in 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The leading LLMs in 2026 are GPT-5.6 Sol, Claude Opus 5, and the frontier models from OpenAI (GPT-5 family), Anthropic (Claude Opus and Sonnet), Google (Gemini 3 Pro), xAI (Grok 4), DeepSeek (V3 / R1) and Z.AI (GLM-5). Open-weights leaders include Llama, Qwen and DeepSeek. The full ranking is in the leaderboard table above.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the cheapest AI model in the top 10?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Grok 4.5 is the cheapest model in the top 10 by GPQA Diamond, at $2.00 /M tok input. The Cheapest filter on the leaderboard restricts to verified, currently-available frontier models — pricing is pulled from each provider's public price list and cross-checked against billing samples through the LLM Stats proxy.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which AI model has the largest context window?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Grok-4 Fast Reasoning currently exposes the largest practical context window at 2.0M tokens tokens. Larger context lets you keep more documents, conversation history and tool traces in a single request. For long-document workloads, also consult the per-model \\\"effective context\\\" notes on each model detail page — providers vary in how well they actually use the upper end of their advertised windows.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the fastest LLM by output speed?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"GPT-4o currently has the highest output throughput at 543 tok/s. Output speed is measured by routing standardized prompts through each provider's API and averaging tokens-per-second over a 7-day rolling window. Fast inference matters most for streaming chat UIs and agentic loops; for batched async workloads, blended price per 1M tokens is usually the better axis.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which is the best open-source AI model?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Kimi K3 currently leads among open-weights LLMs (93.5% gpqa). The open-weights ecosystem is dominated by Llama, Qwen, DeepSeek, Mistral, GLM and Gemma. The dedicated Open LLM Leaderboard filters this catalog to models with publicly released weights so you can self-host or fine-tune.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How is the LLM Stats Score calculated?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The LLM Stats Score is a composite that blends verified benchmark results (GPQA Diamond, SWE-Bench Verified, coding-arena), live performance metrics (output throughput, time-to-first-token) and per-token pricing into one comparable number. Pricing and metadata revalidate hourly; live performance updates on a 7-day rolling average. For the full weighting and refresh cadence see the LLM Stats Score methodology. 350 canonical models are tracked across every major lab and inference provider.\"}}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"29:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"llm-leaderboard-faq\",\"aria-labelledby\":\"leaderboard-seo-heading\",\"className\":\"border-t border-black/[0.05] dark:border-white/[0.06]\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"jsonld-0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$32\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"jsonld-1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$33\"}}]],\"$L34\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2b:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"wins at coding\"}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-1.5 truncate text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.015em] text-black/90 dark:text-white/90 group-hover:text-black dark:group-hover:text-white transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Claude Opus 5\"}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-0.5 tabular-nums text-[14px] tracking-[-0.01em] text-black/50 dark:text-white/45\",\"children\":[\"27\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[12px] text-black/35 dark:text-white/30 ml-0.5\",\"children\":\"arena\"}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2e:[\"$\",\"$L2a\",\"cheapest in the top 10\",{\"href\":\"/models/grok-4.5\",\"className\":\"group min-w-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] text-black/50 dark:text-white/45\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":13,\"height\":13,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"color\":\"currentColor\",\"className\":\"text-amber-500\",\"strokeWidth\":1.75,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"0\",{\"d\":\"M14 18C18.4183 18 22 14.4183 22 10C22 5.58172 18.4183 2 14 2C9.58172 